00:27:51,874 --> 00:27:54,748
oder onfang zeks un fertsik.

613
00:27:54,248 --> 00:27:56,284
s'iz shoyn geven UNK

614
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:57,296
vu zhe zent ir geven in BERLIN? in SCHLACHTSEE?

615
00:27:56,560 --> 00:27:58,826
in SCHLACHTENSEE

616
00:27:58,826 --> 00:28:02,240
yo, ⟨shpet⟩, neyn s'iz nokh nisht geven gemakht di SCHLACHTENSEE.

617
00:28:01,268 --> 00:28:02,399
ah nokh nisht

618
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,838
nokh nisht geven geefnt.

619
00:28:03,838 --> 00:28:06,942
dort me hot ersht geefnt ven ikh bin dort gevezn.

620
00:28:06,942 --> 00:28:09,280
vayl me ⟨geyt⟩ arayn in a rusishe

621
00:28:09,280 --> 00:28:11,972
in a rusishe zone.

622
00:28:09,565 --> 00:28:10,162
zone

623
00:28:11,972 --> 00:28:15,758
me hot nisht gevust ⟨iz⟩ men arayn in rusishe zone un dort iz gevezn a lager.

624
00:28:15,865 --> 00:28:18,730
nakher hot men gezogt az di rusn ⟨UNK⟩zukhn undz

625
00:28:18,730 --> 00:28:22,102
zey viln undz avekshikn UNK ⟨hobn zikh⟩ oysbahaltn

626
00:28:22,294 --> 00:28:27,151
an a nakht un ⟨nakher⟩ a por tog arumge⟨valgert⟩ zikh

627
00:28:27,151 --> 00:28:30,146
me hot ⟨undz⟩ arayn epes getrofn bay ⟨daytshke⟩

628
00:28:30,146 --> 00:28:32,941
un ⟨ikh bin⟩ geven epes a por tog,

629
00:28:32,941 --> 00:28:36,964
nakher hot men arayn, hot men geefnt epes a ambasade

630
00:28:36,964 --> 00:28:41,458
dakht zikh mir a, zey hobn gezogt az s'iz geven a molt der

631
00:28:42,308 --> 00:28:44,293
ambasade fun

632
00:28:45,615 --> 00:28:47,398
fun

633
00:28:47,758 --> 00:28:51,248
Poyln, epes a poylishe ambasade dort gevezn.

634
00:28:51,248 --> 00:28:53,460
hot men dort arayn

635
00:28:53,460 --> 00:28:55,727
me hot undz gebrengt tsu esn yedn tog

636
00:28:55,727 --> 00:28:58,305
broyt mitn m- mit RIBA

637
00:28:58,305 --> 00:29:00,224
mit ⟨kave⟩

638
00:29:00,224 --> 00:29:03,057
un biz me hot geefnt SCHLACHTENSEE.

639
00:29:03,057 --> 00:29:05,117
zenen mir arayn nokh SCHLACHTENSEE.

640
00:29:05,207 --> 00:29:07,428
SCHLACHTENSEE iz shoyn geven gut.

641
00:29:07,435 --> 00:29:12,755
yeder hot ge- hot er gezogt me vil nisht araynnemen di daytshn zoln do arbetn

642
00:29:12,755 --> 00:29:16,654
zol yeder zikh ⟨ot⟩ ver es hot a fakh

643
00:29:16,654 --> 00:29:19,320
zol er geyn ⟨arbetn⟩ zayn fakh

644
00:29:19,320 --> 00:29:20,777
un

645
00:29:21,205 --> 00:29:28,067
un zoln, me zol undz darfn, z- zey arayntsunemen, do zoln zey nisht darfn nokh tsu gebn tsu esn.

646
00:29:28,782 --> 00:29:31,243
s'iz geven, dos iz geven fun di U.N.R.R.A.

647
00:29:31,243 --> 00:29:32,437
fun di

648
00:29:32,022 --> 00:29:33,555
J.O.I.N.T. ⟨un⟩ di U.N.R.R.A.

649
00:29:33,278 --> 00:29:35,259
yo, fun di ⟨U.N.R.R.A.⟩ iz dos gevezn.

